Better Changes was developed from the Changes feature in munza/herdr-workflow,
with behavior and code adapted from Herdr Desktop's shipped Changes mod.
Herdr Desktop is available at https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app and is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This distribution adds tree/flat file lists, staging controls, reusable diff
tabs, inline/split views, configurable typography, documentation, and tests.
